{"page":343,"verses":[{"verse_key":"23:18","surah":23,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَنزَلْنَا مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءًۢ بِقَدَرٍ فَأَسْكَنَّـٰهُ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ وَإِنَّا عَلَىٰ ذَهَابٍۭ بِهِۦ لَقَـٰدِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We sent water down from the sky in due measure and lodged it in the earth––We have the power to take it all away if We so wish––","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَنزَلْنَا","en_gloss":"And We send down","transliteration":"wa-anzalnā","verse_key":"23:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"23:18"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the sky","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"23:18"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَآءًۢ","en_gloss":"water","transliteration":"māan","verse_key":"23:18"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِقَدَرٍۢ","en_gloss":"in (due) measure","transliteration":"biqadarin","verse_key":"23:18"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَأَسْكَنَّـٰهُ","en_gloss":"then We cause it to settle","transliteration":"fa-askannāhu","verse_key":"23:18"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"23:18"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"23:18"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَإِنَّا","en_gloss":"And indeed, We","transliteration":"wa-innā","verse_key":"23:18"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"23:18"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ذَهَابٍۭ","en_gloss":"taking it away","transliteration":"dhahābin","verse_key":"23:18"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"taking it away","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"23:18"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَقَـٰدِرُونَ","en_gloss":"surely (are) Able","transliteration":"laqādirūna","verse_key":"23:18"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٨","en_gloss":"(18)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"23:18"}]},{"verse_key":"23:19","surah":23,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"فَأَنشَأْنَا لَكُم بِهِۦ جَنَّـٰتٍ مِّن نَّخِيلٍ وَأَعْنَـٰبٍ لَّكُمْ فِيهَا فَوَٰكِهُ كَثِيرَةٌ وَمِنْهَا تَأْكُلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"with it We produced for you gardens of date 