d","transliteration":"rabbi","verse_key":"23:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱنصُرْنِى","en_gloss":"Help me","transliteration":"unṣur'nī","verse_key":"23:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"because","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"23:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَذَّبُونِ","en_gloss":"they deny me","transliteration":"kadhabūni","verse_key":"23:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"٢٦","en_gloss":"(26)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"23:26"}]},{"verse_key":"23:27","surah":23,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"فَأَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْهِ أَنِ ٱصْنَعِ ٱلْفُلْكَ بِأَعْيُنِنَا وَوَحْيِنَا فَإِذَا جَآءَ أَمْرُنَا وَفَارَ ٱلتَّنُّورُ ۙ فَٱسْلُكْ فِيهَا مِن كُلٍّ زَوْجَيْنِ ٱثْنَيْنِ وَأَهْلَكَ إِلَّا مَن سَبَقَ عَلَيْهِ ٱلْقَوْلُ مِنْهُمْ ۖ وَلَا تُخَـٰطِبْنِى فِى ٱلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُوٓا۟ ۖ إِنَّهُم مُّغْرَقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and so We revealed to him: ‘Build the Ark under Our watchful eye and according to Our revelation. When Our command comes and water gushes up out of the earth,take pairs of every species on board, and your family, except for those on whom the sentence has already been passed- do not plead with me for the evildoers: they will be drowned-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَأَوْحَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"So We inspired","transliteration":"fa-awḥaynā","verse_key":"23:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"23:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنِ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"ani","verse_key":"23:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱصْنَعِ","en_gloss":"construct","transliteration":"iṣ'naʿi","verse_key":"23:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْفُلْكَ","en_gloss":"the ship","transliteration":"l-ful'ka","verse_key":"23:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِأَعْيُنِنَا","en_gloss":"under Our eyes","transliteration":"bi-aʿyuninā","verse_key":"23:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَوَحْيِنَا","en_gloss":"and Our inspiration","transliteration":"wawaḥyinā","verse_key":"23:27"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"then when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"23:27"},{"pos":9,"ar":"جَآءَ","en_gloss":"comes","trans